{"chunk_id": "a95808cfdc18", "text": "As the war in Lanka intensifies, the titan general Prahasta marches out with a vast army. His departure is accompanied by terrifying omens\u2014meteors, blood\u2011rain, howling jackals, and circling vultures\u2014signaling impending doom. Rama asks Vibhishana about the formidable warrior, learning that Prahasta commands a third of Ravana\u2019s forces and is famed for mastery of weapons. A massive battle erupts between the rakshasas and the monkey army, with trees and boulders clashing against arrows and maces. Prahasta\u2019s companions and several monkey heroes kill one another in rapid succession, and the battlefield becomes a grotesque river of blood and broken weapons. Finally the monkey general Nila confronts Prahasta directly. After a brutal duel of arrows, trees, and maces, Nila hurls a massive rock that crushes Prahasta\u2019s head, killing him and sending the titan army fleeing back to Lanka.\nDemon general Prahasta leads a massive assault but is ultimately slain by the monkey chief Nila after a brutal battle.\nThemes: heroic combat, omens of doom, warfare chaos, duel of champions, fall of a commander", "vector": [0.0029518830124288797, -0.034938111901283264, 0.0003118856402579695, -7.597075637022499e-06, -0.0004271665238775313, 0.013468614779412746, -0.015974082052707672, -0.0021594080608338118, -0.016735412180423737, -0.017469055950641632, 0.013766225427389145, 0.00016924446390476078, 0.011945955455303192, -0.008305415511131287, 0.012700363993644714, 0.002548724180087447, 0.039976730942726135, -0.014811323955655098, 0.01838265173137188, -0.0006635680911131203, 0.001421437249518931, -0.003490004688501358, -0.0028584471438080072, -0.010347163304686546, -0.01622324436903, 0.015171225182712078, 0.010381769388914108, -0.027920037508010864, 0.004443397279828787, -0.010056473314762115, -0.003789345733821392, -0.013586275279521942, -0.003159518353641033, -0.013980782590806484, -0.0224661473184824, -0.011039281263947487, 0.0